839081302f85a43ab996e878fdd4a780df4862fdaa34a1e58e722a1bcc7a30d847b82f120255a1b9c18f0a0bf80cfd14339f33f434b8862a68e04353720832e6  0001-use-gamescope-session-plus.patch
2e0638452cbf3032c931da136969489ff2d864edcb112818b5ad9144efa19c66d8c110ebb1a665fcb230f0d10fee5a103f46293e0b813265d9bc81e82feed763  0002-use-plasmalogin.patch
"
